# Exceptions for the scrapers-browser READY F01 build gate
# (apps/scrapers-browser/Dockerfile runs this one test INSIDE the image).
# Without them the gate died with "file or directory not found" on the
# 2026-09-14 production build — the `tests` line above removes the whole
# tree from every build context. Only the gate's own file, the root
# conftest it relies on, and the package marker are re-included.
!tests/conftest.py
!tests/integration/__init__.py
!tests/integration/test_browser_egress_guard_image.py
README.md
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
